OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham to hand long-range missile
OL,4,Ablueprints to Zelensky as he visits
OL,5,AKyiv
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is also set to accept an award on
OL,8,Fbehalf of the British people
OL,9,Frecognising the UK's support for
OL,10,FUkraine and to take part in
OL,11,Findependence day events.
OL,13,FCrucially for the war effort, he will
OL,14,Fannounce his government has agreed to
OL,15,Fallow defence company MBDA to
OL,16,Fdeclassify information on UK components
OL,17,Ffor the long-range Scalp missile ` the
OL,18,FFrench equivalent of the UK's Storm
OL,19,FShadow.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
