OL,3,AReview launched into how pub and hotel
OL,4,Abusiness rates calculated
OL,5,
OL,6,FPub groups have argued they face
OL,7,Fdisproportionately higher rates bills,
OL,8,Fbut other businesses have called for a
OL,9,Fwider reform of the rates system.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
