OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump says Canada wants 'benefits' of
OL,4,Abeing US state after trade talks
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,8,Fcalled the fresh tariffs a
OL,9,F"miscalculation" designed to "hurt and
OL,10,Fdivide us".
OL,12,FCarney confirmed he would match Trump's
OL,13,Ftariffs "dollar-for-dollar" from 8
OL,14,FSeptember, including levies on steel,
OL,15,Fdairy, appliances and electronics. The
OL,16,FUS and Canada are now in a trade "war",
OL,17,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
