OL,3,AEx-cricket captains urge 'proper
OL,4,Amedical care' for Imran Khan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of former cricket captains,
OL,7,Fincluding Indian batting legend Sunil
OL,8,FGavaskar and one of England's
OL,9,Flongest-serving skippers Sir Alastair
OL,10,FCook, have called on Pakistan to ensure
OL,11,Fits ex-PM Imran Khan be given proper
OL,12,Fcare while in custody.
OL,14,FThe cricketer-turned-politician has
OL,15,Fbeen in jail since 2023 on corruption
OL,16,Fcharges which he denies.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
