OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEx-cricket captains urge 'proper
OL,4,Amedical care' for Imran Khan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter to Pakistan's current
OL,7,Fleader Shehbaz Sharif, the 21 former
OL,8,Fskippers aired concern that Khan, 73,
OL,9,Fwas allowed "only a few hours" at a
OL,10,Fhospital last week where he was
OL,11,Fexamined by a state-appointed team.
OL,13,FKhan's party has also filed a contempt
OL,14,Fpetition against the government for not
OL,15,Fgiving him access to his own doctors,
OL,16,Fas ordered by the top court.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
